	"nodes":[
		{"id":"e859574d1b84a4d2","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\nflowchart TB\n  CEO[\"CEO / Leadership<br/>Chat UI\"]\n\n  subgraph Control[\"Athena Control Plane\"]\n    In[\"Incoming message<br/>+ conversation history\"]\n    Router[\"Intent Router<br/>• product status<br/>• people / ownership<br/>• decision / risk<br/>• enterprise context<br/>• document hunt<br/>• out of scope\"]\n    Plan[\"Retrieval Contract<br/>• required sources by intent<br/>• tool pack subset<br/>• citation rules\"]\n    Gate{\"Evidence pack<br/>complete?\"}\n    Synth[\"Chief of Staff Synthesizer<br/>• one accountable voice<br/>• recommendation + confidence<br/>• cite sources / gaps\"]\n    Verify[\"Selective Verify<br/>only high-stakes<br/>• claim vs evidence<br/>• tracker vs workgraph conflicts\"]\n    Out[\"SSE response<br/>thinking / tools / answer\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Packs[\"Specialist Retrieval Packs — advisors, not speakers\"]\n    KN[\"Knowledge Pack<br/>search_knowledge<br/>get_knowledge_document<br/>index_onedrive…\"]\n    WG[\"Workgraph / Task Pack<br/>analyze_product_execution<br/>search_work_tasks<br/>search_work_users…\"]\n    EK[\"Enterprise Knowledge Pack<br/>read_enterprise_knowledge<br/>read_enterprise_knowledge_item\"]\n    OD[\"OneDrive Pack<br/>search_onedrive<br/>read_onedrive_file\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Data[\"Evidence Stores\"]\n    PG[(\"Postgres<br/>intelligence + workgraph\")]\n    QD[(\"Qdrant<br/>RAG chunks\")]\n    Snap[(\"EK snapshot\")]\n    MCP[\"MCP Toolkit<br/>OneDrive / Graph\"]\n  end\n\n  AOAI[\"Azure OpenAI<br/>• classify / synthesize<br/>• optional follow-up tools<br/>• not free-form over all tools\"]\n\n  CEO --> In --> Router --> Plan\n  Plan -->|parallel required fetch| KN & WG & EK & OD\n  KN --> QD & PG\n  WG --> PG\n  EK --> Snap\n  OD --> MCP\n  KN & WG & EK & OD --> Gate\n  Gate -->|missing required source| Plan\n  Gate -->|enough evidence| Synth\n  Synth <--> AOAI\n  Synth --> Verify\n  Verify -->|conflict / weak grounding| Plan\n  Verify -->|pass or N/A| Out --> CEO\n\n  classDef cos fill:#1e3a5f,stroke:#93c5fd,color:#fff\n  classDef pack fill:#14532d,stroke:#86efac,color:#fff\n  classDef store fill:#3f3f46,stroke:#d4d4d8,color:#fff\n  class Router,Plan,Synth,Verify,Gate cos\n  class KN,WG,EK,OD pack\n  class PG,QD,Snap,MCP store\n\n```","x":-312,"y":-1120,"width":2672,"height":1880},
		{"id":"11644b27aa25b065","x":2640,"y":-1120,"width":2280,"height":2120,"type":"text","text":"```mermaid\nflowchart TB\n  subgraph UI[\"Athena Frontend\"]\n    Chat[\"Chat UI<br/>• send messages<br/>• render SSE: thinking / tool_start / tool_end / chunk\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Athena[\"Athena Backend — FastAPI\"]\n    Routes[\"/athena routes<br/>• auth + conversations<br/>• StreamingResponse SSE\"]\n    Loop[\"Agent Loop<br/>• assemble system + history<br/>• register tool schemas<br/>• call model up to MAX_AGENT_TURNS=5<br/>• execute tool_calls<br/>• append role=tool results\"]\n    Client[\"AthenaAIClient<br/>• sole Azure OpenAI boundary<br/>• chat.completions + tools + stream\"]\n    Dispatch[\"_execute_tool_call<br/>• route by function name<br/>• best-effort string results\"]\n\n    subgraph Tools[\"Curated OpenAI tool surface\"]\n      OD[\"ONEDRIVE_TOOLS<br/>search / read\"]\n      KN[\"KNOWLEDGE_TOOLS<br/>RAG search / index\"]\n      EK[\"ENTERPRISE_KNOWLEDGE_TOOLS<br/>snapshot list / item\"]\n      WG[\"WORKGRAPH_TOOLS<br/>tasks / users / execution\"]\n    end\n  end\n\n  subgraph Model[\"Azure OpenAI\"]\n    AOAI[\"Chat Completions<br/>• tool_choice=auto<br/>• decides tools vs final answer\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Store[\"Athena data plane\"]\n    PG[(\"Postgres<br/>conversations, chat_messages,<br/>intelligence, workgraph\")]\n    QD[(\"Qdrant<br/>knowledge + entity embeddings\")]\n    Snap[(\"Enterprise Knowledge snapshot<br/>Outlook / Calendar / Teams\")]\n  end\n\n  subgraph MCP[\"MCP Toolkit — Fastify\"]\n    Ext[\"/external/tools/call/:tool<br/>• app-token + X-Tenant-Id<br/>• synthetic tenant config\"]\n    Reg[\"Provider Registry<br/>• plugin load<br/>• 149+ providers / 1383+ tools\"]\n    Exec[\"Tool execute<br/>• circuit breaker<br/>• rate limit<br/>• audit log\"]\n    Proto[\"/mcp Streamable HTTP<br/>• ListTools / CallTool<br/>(generic MCP clients)\"]\n  end\n\n  ExtAPI[\"External APIs<br/>Microsoft OneDrive / Graph, etc.\"]\n\n  Chat -->|POST message| Routes\n  Routes --> Loop\n  Loop --> Client\n  Client <-->|messages + tools| AOAI\n  Loop --> Dispatch\n  Dispatch --> OD & KN & EK & WG\n  Loop <-->|persist turns| PG\n  KN --> PG & QD\n  EK --> Snap\n  WG --> PG\n  OD -->|HTTP adapter| Ext\n  Ext --> Reg --> Exec --> ExtAPI\n  Proto -.->|not used by Athena chat loop| Reg\n\n  classDef primary fill:#1e3a5f,stroke:#93c5fd,color:#fff\n  classDef secondary fill:#14532d,stroke:#86efac,color:#fff\n  classDef store fill:#3f3f46,stroke:#d4d4d8,color:#fff\n  class Loop,Client,Dispatch primary\n  class Ext,Reg,Exec secondary\n  class PG,QD,Snap store\n\n```"}
